# Phase 4 — Strategy Optimization and Adaptive Strategy Selection

## 1. Document Purpose

This document defines Phase 4 of the Self-Improving Agent POC.

Phase 4 extends the Phase 3 system from:

> **Remember → Evaluate → Learn**

to:

> **Try different strategies → Evaluate → Compare → Select the better strategy → Remember the result**

The objective is to demonstrate that the agent can learn which problem-solving strategy works better for a particular type of task and use that knowledge for future requests.

This phase must remain a local, deterministic, testable POC.

