# 35. Error Isolation

Strategy optimization MUST NOT break the main agent response.

If:

```text
Strategy Selector fails
```

the system should fall back to:

```text
default strategy
```

If:

```text
Strategy Evaluation fails
```

the main answer should still be returned.

If:

```text
Strategy Learning fails
```

the main answer and existing evaluation must remain available.

If:

```text
GraphQLite operation fails
```

the main answer and SQLite records should remain available where possible.

