# 44. Expected Phase 4 Behavior

The important behavior to demonstrate is:

```text
FIRST REQUEST

Task
 ↓
No historical strategy knowledge
 ↓
Explore available strategies
 ↓
Execute
 ↓
Evaluate
 ↓
Store result
```

After multiple requests:

```text
Historical Data

Strategy A → 80%
Strategy B → 95%
Strategy C → 87%
```

Then:

```text
NEW REQUEST
     ↓
Task Type = calculation
     ↓
Strategy Selector
     ↓
Strategy B
     ↓
Execute
     ↓
Evaluate
     ↓
Update Strategy B statistics
```

Therefore the system has progressed from:

```text
"I remember what happened."
```

to:

```text
"I know what happened."
```

to:

```text
"I learned what worked better."
```

That is the primary objective of Phase 4.

